      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAREFOOT JOHNNY (1) got the job done again making it three on end, scoring by 1.5 lengths (19.97) at this track over 366m. Form from his last run is proving strong. Can continue on his winning ways. SONALI (2) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a 6 length third over 525m Wagga in 30.61. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Overdue and expected to feature again. HE'S REGAL (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (25.56) at Q Lakeside behind Gramercy Garry in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to give a sight. The form out of last race has been strong. Will give a great sight again. AFFILIATED (7) must be included in calculations.",
